# 030 dice (machines/030-dice/docs/DICE.md): while SW1 is held, U4 passes the 1 MHz clock
# to U1 as ROLL_CLK; U1 counts 1 to 6 and loads 1 again after 6 (SIX_N). On release the count
# stops. U2-U4 decode N0-N2 into four active-low LED groups; each LED is lit while its group
# is low: ODD_N centre D4, TWO_N diagonal D1/D7, FOUR_N diagonal D2/D6, SIX_N middle row D3/D5.

part X1 OSC freq=1MHz
part J1 POWER
part SW1 BUTTON legend=ROLL
part R1 R value=4k7
part R2 R value=330
part R3 R value=330
part R4 R value=330
part R5 R value=330
part R6 R value=330
part R7 R value=330
part R8 R value=330
part R9 R value=4k7
part U1 74LS161
part U2 74LS04
part U3 74LS00
part U4 74LS02
part D1 LED
part D2 LED
part D3 LED
part D4 LED
part D5 LED
part D6 LED
part D7 LED

net CLK      X1.OUT U4.1A
net BTN_N    R9.2 SW1.1 U4.1B
net ROLL_CLK U4.1Y U1.CLK
net RESET_N  R1.2 U1.CLR_N
net VCC      R1.1 R2.1 R3.1 R4.1 R5.1 R6.1 R7.1 R8.1 R9.1 U1.ENP U1.ENT U1.A
net GND      SW1.2 U1.B U1.C U1.D
net GND      U2.3A U2.4A U2.5A U2.6A U3.2A U3.2B U3.3A U3.3B U3.4A U3.4B U4.3A U4.3B U4.4A U4.4B

net N0       U1.QA U2.1A
net N1       U1.QB U3.1A U4.2A
net N2       U1.QC U2.2A U3.1B U4.2B

net ODD_N    U2.1Y D4.K
net FOUR_N   U2.2Y D2.K D6.K
net TWO_N    U4.2Y D1.K D7.K
net SIX_N    U3.1Y U1.LOAD_N D3.K D5.K

net LED_A1   R2.2 D1.A
net LED_A2   R3.2 D2.A
net LED_A3   R4.2 D3.A
net LED_A4   R5.2 D4.A
net LED_A5   R6.2 D5.A
net LED_A6   R7.2 D6.A
net LED_A7   R8.2 D7.A
